  "details": "Currently, the VRChat Radial Menu allows for custom icons to be assigned to menu items, but these icons remain static and cannot be changed dynamically during runtime. It would be incredibly useful to have a feature that allows menu item icons to be updated in real time.\n\nUse Case:\n\nA toggle button in the Radial Menu could visually reflect its current state (e.g., switching between an \"On\" and \"Off\" icon).",
